     "textwithimage": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/tq-systems/arm-modules/TQMa91xxCA Embedded Cortex®-A55 module%0A.jpeg",
      "imageRatio": "40",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "TQMa91xxCA board",
      "text": "<h1>Based on i.MX 91xx</h1>\n<p>The TQMa91xxCA Embedded Module, based on NXP's i.MX 91 series blends Arm® Cortex®-A55 power with diverse interfaces for high-volume embedded computing. With a focus on efficiency, low power (2W), and data security (Advanced Secure Element SE050), it suits industrial automation. Key features include 2x Gbit Ethernet, 2x USB 2.0, gyroscope sensor, and compatibility with 2GB LPDDR4 RAM, up to 256 GB eMMC, and various interfaces. Compact (54mm x 32mm) and robust, it operates in challenging environments and is supported by Linux and FreeRTOS. Partnered with NXP, it's your reliable choice for NXP-based projects.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 03:21:05 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
